# viz/schema holds the DataObject schema and column lineage documents written by an SDLB
# dry-run with --test dry-run-with-lineage-export, one DataObject~<id>.schema.json /
# .lineage.json per output DataObject, with the @column descriptions of
# global.descriptionPath merged into the schemas, plus one .stats.json per DataObject
# written by DataObjectSchemaExporter --withSchema false.
#
# The workflow regenerates them on every run and commits them back to the repository
# together with viz/state/. This file keeps the directory in git, so that startJob.sh has a
# real bind-mount source in a fresh clone.
